#: ../../howto/transfers-administration.rst:2 744545004bbc4ea4b3487502ad565ace
msgid "Transfers and administration"
msgstr "转账与管理"

#: ../../howto/transfers-administration.rst:6 0dd59b3bc440446abce1a5f73a8084bb
msgid ""
"The methods on this page can move funds, spend fees, change account "
"authority, alter protocol state, or perform irreversible conversions. The"
" transfer examples are executable signed-action fragments: copying and "
"running one can move real assets. Confirm the network, execution address,"
" destination, units, permissions, and recovery procedure before signing, "
"and start on testnet."
msgstr ""
"本页方法可转移资金、花费费用、改变账户权限、更改协议状态或执行不可逆转换。转账示例是可执行的签名操作片段：复制并运行其中一个就可能转移真实资产。签名前请确认网络、执行地址、目标地址、单位、权限和恢复流程，并从"
" testnet 开始。"

#: ../../howto/transfers-administration.rst:13 93739c7040c3415eb3551ddc2df90658
msgid "Fund movement"
msgstr "资金转移"

#: ../../howto/transfers-administration.rst:15 e95aee8a0a324b7b892e0b4cc74a8391
msgid "Coin-resolving methods live on ``AsyncHyperliquid``:"
msgstr "解析 coin 的方法位于 ``AsyncHyperliquid``："

#: ../../howto/transfers-administration.rst:17 f43c48ac361548f0a9b82719483a3b5c
msgid "``spot_transfer`` sends a spot token after resolving its token metadata;"
msgstr "``spot_transfer`` 在解析 token 元数据后发送一个 spot token；"

#: ../../howto/transfers-administration.rst:18 fca475521b5943ea8305362f75d5bf0b
msgid "``send_asset`` moves a token between DEX contexts or destinations;"
msgstr "``send_asset`` 在 DEX 上下文或目标地址之间转移 token；"

#: ../../howto/transfers-administration.rst:19 2a4c1da7f7a74b23a50302d2941ccb97
msgid "``agent_send_asset`` submits the agent-signed variant;"
msgstr "``agent_send_asset`` 提交 agent 签名的变体；"

#: ../../howto/transfers-administration.rst:20 517678c0366d48f8b8a63495454c70ec
msgid ""
"``send_to_evm_with_data`` sends a token to an external-chain recipient "
"with caller-supplied encoding, chain ID, gas limit, and data."
msgstr "``send_to_evm_with_data`` 使用调用方提供的编码、链 ID、gas 限制和数据，将 token 发送给外部链上的接收方。"

#: ../../howto/transfers-administration.rst:23 06796810b16e48b389fc8e5ad758cbaf
msgid "Info-independent methods live on ``client.exchange``:"
msgstr "不依赖 Info 的方法位于 ``client.exchange``："

#: ../../howto/transfers-administration.rst:25 d589c5578c474e93b9cbcb43f62ee20d
msgid "``usd_transfer`` sends USD;"
msgstr "``usd_transfer`` 发送 USD；"

#: ../../howto/transfers-administration.rst:26 31088225d08a4525b835dd2881e200bc
msgid "``withdraw`` initiates a withdrawal;"
msgstr "``withdraw`` 发起提现；"

#: ../../howto/transfers-administration.rst:27 35f56caaaf3e40b1b18d3024549f4b2f
msgid "``usd_class_transfer`` moves USD between spot and perpetual classes;"
msgstr "``usd_class_transfer`` 在 spot 与 perpetual 类别之间转移 USD；"

#: ../../howto/transfers-administration.rst:28 097ef3e050ef475cbd67b7c0bb9c00df
msgid "``vault_transfer`` deposits to or withdraws from a vault;"
msgstr "``vault_transfer`` 向 vault 存入或从中提取资金；"

#: ../../howto/transfers-administration.rst:29 f59ad278554d459183ed75b169028cb2
msgid "``hip3_liquidator_transfer`` moves quote notional for a HIP-3 liquidator;"
msgstr "``hip3_liquidator_transfer`` 为 HIP-3 清算人转移报价名义金额；"

#: ../../howto/transfers-administration.rst:30 22634152a50040b1b9b5c3d7f8687157
msgid ""
"``staking_deposit``, ``staking_withdraw``, and ``token_delegate`` change "
"staking balances or delegation."
msgstr "``staking_deposit``、``staking_withdraw`` 和 ``token_delegate`` 更改质押余额或委托。"

#: ../../howto/transfers-administration.rst:33 1e2a71e2f1bb4b9baa7161d7b7e88501
msgid ""
"User-signed fund actions do not accept ``expires_after``. A timeout still"
" leaves their result indeterminate; reconcile balances and ledgers before"
" replacement."
msgstr "用户签名的资金操作不接受 ``expires_after``。超时仍会使其结果不确定；替换前请核对余额和账本。"

#: ../../howto/transfers-administration.rst:37 6fd47fc3fe414664aba4b32c424e6c8a
msgid "Transfer examples"
msgstr "转账示例"

#: ../../howto/transfers-administration.rst:39 cc5340320bc341e88c607f37378ecaf4
msgid ""
"The examples below are independent ``async main`` fragments, not a "
"sequence to run. They assume an authenticated testnet ``client`` prepared"
" as shown in :doc:`../introduction/quickstart`. Supply every value "
"explicitly through your environment, inspect it before signing, and run "
"only the one operation you intend. The SDK does not verify that a "
"destination belongs to you."
msgstr ""
"以下示例是相互独立的 ``async main`` 片段，并非要连续运行的操作序列。它们假设已按 "
":doc:`../introduction/quickstart` 准备好经过身份验证的 testnet "
"``client``。请通过环境变量显式提供每个值，在签名前检查这些值，并且只运行你明确需要的那一个操作。SDK 不会验证目标地址是否属于你。"

#: ../../howto/transfers-administration.rst:46 4fc0d4d8dc7049b186270bb2ad13e9ab
msgid "Response check"
msgstr "响应检查"

#: ../../howto/transfers-administration.rst:48 e5a3199d46f54aa79e8bc17aaee59312
msgid ""
"Run the chosen operation after this small response helper. An Exchange "
"rejection is returned as data instead of raised as a Python exception."
msgstr "请在这个小型响应 helper 之后运行选定的操作。Exchange 拒绝会作为数据返回，而不是作为 Python 异常抛出。"

#: ../../howto/transfers-administration.rst:59 ddfac1022b4a4984bf59ab7d92824660
msgid ""
"Amounts are human-readable units. The SDK truncates excess fractional "
"digits toward zero when encoding these actions: USD sends, withdrawals, "
"and class transfers use 2 decimals; vault USD uses 6; HYPE uses 8; and "
"token transfers use the token's ``weiDecimals`` metadata. Validate or "
"quantize the input yourself if silent truncation is not acceptable. The "
"HIP-3 liquidator call instead requires no more than 6 decimal places and "
"an exact multiple of 1,000 quote tokens."
msgstr ""
"数量使用人类可读单位。SDK 编码这些操作时，会朝零方向截断超出精度的小数位：USD 发送、提现和类别转账使用 2 位小数；vault USD "
"使用 6 位；HYPE 使用 8 位；token 转账使用 token 的 ``weiDecimals`` "
"元数据。如果不能接受静默截断，请自行验证或量化输入。HIP-3 清算人调用则要求不超过 6 位小数，并且必须是 1,000 个报价 token 的整数倍。"

#: ../../howto/transfers-administration.rst:67 b62038a8f42e457eb0c3dd3734b7a925
msgid "Direct account transfers"
msgstr "直接账户转账"

#: ../../howto/transfers-administration.rst:69 910eab13ca7948959e96a8e0e7d8af36
msgid "Send a spot token after resolving ``coin`` to its token ID and decimals:"
msgstr "将 ``coin`` 解析为 token ID 和小数精度后发送 spot token："

#: ../../howto/transfers-administration.rst:83 2edb32023cd84c4fbfe5596b36630fe2
msgid "Send USD directly to another address:"
msgstr "将 USD 直接发送到另一个地址："

#: ../../howto/transfers-administration.rst:95 8c1c025eacdf481fbf91802862773283
msgid ""
"Initiate a withdrawal to an explicit destination. Omitting "
"``destination`` uses the configured account address, but an explicit "
"value is easier to audit. The official Exchange API currently documents a"
" $1 fee and approximately five minutes to finality; verify the current "
"terms in the `Exchange endpoint`_ before signing:"
msgstr ""
"向显式目标地址发起提现。省略 ``destination`` 会使用已配置的账户地址，但显式填写更便于审计。官方 Exchange API "
"当前记录的费用为 1 美元，完成约需五分钟；签名前请在 `Exchange endpoint`_ 核实最新条件："

#: ../../howto/transfers-administration.rst:112
#: 38c6ac69de534778ac182e3580c96208
msgid "DEX and external destinations"
msgstr "DEX 与外部目标地址"

#: ../../howto/transfers-administration.rst:114
#: 5b1236e9023f4da0a71f9a980134fbac
msgid ""
"Move a token between DEX contexts with a user-signed ``send_asset`` "
"action. Use ``\"\"`` for the default USDC perpetual DEX and ``\"spot\"`` "
"for spot. Only the collateral token may move to or from a perpetual DEX; "
"see `Send Asset`_:"
msgstr ""
"使用用户签名的 ``send_asset`` 操作在 DEX 上下文之间移动 token。使用 ``\"\"`` 表示默认 USDC 永续 "
"DEX，使用 ``\"spot\"`` 表示 spot。只有抵押 token 可以转入或转出永续 DEX；参见 `Send Asset`_："

#: ../../howto/transfers-administration.rst:132
#: 64cc8354064f494997610b78e9953e21
msgid ""
"The agent-signed variant accepts ``expires_after``. The deadline is an "
"absolute millisecond timestamp and does not make an acknowledged transfer"
" reversible:"
msgstr "agent 签名的变体接受 ``expires_after``。该期限是绝对毫秒时间戳，且不会让已经确认的转账变得可逆："

#: ../../howto/transfers-administration.rst:153
#: cf2356f2df0a40a1b15e075c7cf59418
msgid ""
"For an external EVM destination, provide the chain, gas, recipient "
"encoding, and call data. ``data=\"0x\"`` means no call data; use non-"
"empty data only after validating the destination contract and payload "
"outside the SDK:"
msgstr ""
"对于外部 EVM 目标，请提供链、gas、接收方编码和调用数据。``data=\"0x\"`` 表示没有调用数据；只有在 SDK "
"外部验证目标合约和 payload 后，才能使用非空数据："

#: ../../howto/transfers-administration.rst:174
#: e3b468141b444cc3abd97a832891a616
msgid "USD classes"
msgstr "USD 资产类别"

#: ../../howto/transfers-administration.rst:176
#: f4c8d6c3523047d395ca45c48bef6c46
msgid ""
"Move USD from spot to perpetuals with ``to_perp=True``. Use ``False`` for"
" the reverse direction; do not run both calls merely to test "
"connectivity:"
msgstr ""
"使用 ``to_perp=True`` 将 USD 从 spot 移至 perpetuals。反向移动时使用 "
"``False``；不要仅为了测试连通性而同时运行两个方向："

#: ../../howto/transfers-administration.rst:189
#: 27ce379ba1824613896bd6b76ccabc86
msgid "Vault and HIP-3 transfers"
msgstr "Vault 与 HIP-3 转账"

#: ../../howto/transfers-administration.rst:191
#: a695d4c5b10e4916af22fcb1efa8a7af
msgid ""
"Deposit USD into a vault with ``is_deposit=True``. Use ``False`` only "
"when you intend to withdraw from that vault:"
msgstr "使用 ``is_deposit=True`` 将 USD 存入 vault。仅在你确实要从该 vault 提取时使用 ``False``："

#: ../../howto/transfers-administration.rst:203
#: fcb861d6257f491f9f873854077f59a4
msgid ""
"A HIP-3 liquidator transfer requires a positive amount that is an exact "
"multiple of 1,000 quote tokens. Use ``is_deposit=False`` for the reverse "
"direction:"
msgstr "HIP-3 清算人转账要求数量为 1,000 个报价 token 的正整数倍。反向移动时使用 ``is_deposit=False``："

#: ../../howto/transfers-administration.rst:216
#: ecaccc39945c4f6bbfa903043bec8b17
msgid "Staking and delegation"
msgstr "质押与委托"

#: ../../howto/transfers-administration.rst:218
#: 5a13e8b0857e4f59a06559b7687779e6
msgid "Move HYPE into the staking balance:"
msgstr "将 HYPE 转入质押余额："

#: ../../howto/transfers-administration.rst:227
#: 5b413c10f84e4e58a631a218bc9d5934
msgid ""
"Move HYPE out of the staking balance. This starts a seven-day unstaking "
"queue; an address may have at most five pending withdrawals:"
msgstr "将 HYPE 转出质押余额。这会启动一个七天的解除质押队列；每个地址最多可有五笔待处理提现："

#: ../../howto/transfers-administration.rst:237
#: c8cf28d8527e468fb3061650b8363d9d
msgid ""
"Delegate HYPE to a validator. Set ``undelegate=True`` only for the "
"reverse operation. Delegation to a validator has a one-day lockup; see "
"`Staking`_:"
msgstr ""
"将 HYPE 委托给验证者。仅在执行反向操作时设置 ``undelegate=True``。对某个验证者的委托有一天锁定期；参见 "
"`Staking`_："

#: ../../howto/transfers-administration.rst:250
#: c5208464beba42aa8d28c77244baa450
msgid "Account administration"
msgstr "账户管理"

#: ../../howto/transfers-administration.rst:252
#: 61ae42b3cb83455597025baab346edf8
msgid ""
"The Exchange client exposes ``set_referrer_code``, "
"``create_sub_account``, ``use_big_blocks``, ``approve_agent``, "
"``approve_builder_fee``, ``convert_to_multi_sig_user``, account-"
"abstraction methods, and agent-abstraction methods. Approval and multisig"
" changes alter authority; conversion may not have a simple inverse. Read "
"the current role and abstraction state first, then verify it again "
"through trusted Info after acknowledgement."
msgstr ""
"Exchange 客户端提供 "
"``set_referrer_code``、``create_sub_account``、``use_big_blocks``、``approve_agent``、``approve_builder_fee``、``convert_to_multi_sig_user``、账户抽象方法和"
" agent 抽象方法。批准和多签更改会改变权限；转换可能没有简单的逆操作。请先读取当前角色和抽象状态，再在收到确认后通过可信的 Info "
"再次验证。"

#: ../../howto/transfers-administration.rst:259
#: 445600fc138f47e8abe4be12295afd86
msgid ""
"``reserve_request_weight`` is a paid action. ``schedule_cancel`` affects "
"open orders. ``noop`` advances or reserves the client's nonce stream. "
"None should be used as a generic health check."
msgstr ""
"``reserve_request_weight`` 是付费操作。``schedule_cancel`` 会影响开放订单。``noop`` "
"推进或保留客户端的 nonce 流。它们都不应用作通用健康检查。"

#: ../../howto/transfers-administration.rst:264
#: 15757359c7b74a519bbd474b7dff96ba
msgid "Outcome and validator actions"
msgstr "Outcome 与验证者操作"

#: ../../howto/transfers-administration.rst:266
#: 7ef0619a90464b5f8ddf0dd571535748
msgid ""
"``split_outcome``, ``merge_outcome``, ``merge_question``, and "
"``negate_outcome`` alter outcome-token state. ``vote_risk_free_rate`` and"
" ``authorize_aqav2_role`` are privileged validator or administrative "
"actions. ``claim_rewards`` changes claimable state. Validate protocol-"
"specific eligibility and units outside the SDK before calling them."
msgstr ""
"``split_outcome``、``merge_outcome``、``merge_question`` 和 "
"``negate_outcome`` 会改变 outcome-token 状态。``vote_risk_free_rate`` 和 "
"``authorize_aqav2_role`` 是有特权的验证者或管理操作。``claim_rewards`` 更改可领取状态。调用前请在 "
"SDK 外部验证协议特定的资格和单位。"

#: ../../howto/transfers-administration.rst:273
#: d72a966bb5d34c09ba49b52952439209
msgid "Response discipline"
msgstr "响应规范"

#: ../../howto/transfers-administration.rst:275
#: 2702295b8e9e47cab8bd549697f739fe
msgid ""
"These methods usually return ``DefaultActionResponse``. A returned JSON "
"object may still have ``status == \"err\"``; that is an Exchange "
"rejection, not a Python exception. Network ambiguity is handled "
"separately as described in :doc:`lifecycle-reconciliation`."
msgstr ""
"这些方法通常返回 ``DefaultActionResponse``。返回的 JSON 对象仍可能具有 ``status == "
"\"err\"``；那是 Exchange 拒绝，而不是 Python 异常。网络不确定性按 :doc:`lifecycle-"
"reconciliation` 所述单独处理。"

